    {
      "title": "RGB Signatures",
      "desc": "Onchain binary values",
      "year": "2024",
      "images": [
        "/work/art/rgb/signatures.gif",
        "/work/art/rgb/signatures.webp"
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/01.webp",
          "text": "RGB values follow an 8-bit color model: a range of 0 to 255 for each R, G, and B channel.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRigAAABXRUJQVlA4IBwAAAAwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAA3AA/vyzqbwxgAAA"
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/02.webp",
          "text": "Encoded into binary, values can be expressed in 2 states: 0 & 1.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRigAAABXRUJQVlA4IBwAAAAwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAA3AA/vyzpP+60AAA"
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/03.webp",
          "text": "Visually, 0 is represented by a black square and 1 by a white square.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRigAAABXRUJQVlA4IBwAAAAwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAA3AA/vyzqZNpFAAA"
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/04.webp",
          "text": "The squares represent the binary values for each R, G, and B channel: 3 sets of 8 binary strings, 24 values in total.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRj4AAABXRUJQVlA4IDIAAABwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQEGAAG4AD+/KzTuteuGBgWTWNcGz4lGL2fZ9Wy9/zj4AAAAA=="
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/05.webp",
          "text": "These visual values are arranged sequentially around a perfect square, with an empty space in the center.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRiYAAABXRUJQVlA4IBoAAAAwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAA3AA/vyzqJQAAA=="
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/06.webp",
          "text": "Markers are placed at the R, G, and B starting points. One marker is placed in the center.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRjYAAABXRUJQVlA4ICoAAACwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAAxU/n3GYAP7+7XxX3b8V8hvab0FspoAAAAA="
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/07.webp",
          "text": "Combined altogether results in an RGB Signature.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRjYAAABXRUJQVlA4ICoAAACwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQAAp1YqhMAAP7+7X+4bLEAnaP8DGxd3wuQAAA="
        },
        {
          "image": "/work/art/rgb/08.webp",
          "text": "There are 16,777,216 RGB Signatures in total. No two are alike and each one can only be minted once.",
          "blurDataURL": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRjQAAABXRUJQVlA4ICgAAABwAQCdASoKAAUAAUAmJaQ24QAXQAD+/LZo2ylNyfCplZA6RAEQAAAA"
        }
      ],
      "size": "16,777,216",
      "type": [
        "NFT"
      ],
      "collectionHref": "https://rgb.fun/",
      "collectionLabel": "Collect on rgb.fun",
      "icon": null
    },
